WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.920
The school Saturday covers sepsis recognition and anaphylaxis, while Wednesday emphasizes early maternal sepsis and useful differential checks. This workshop joins those tasks through clinical decisions.
学校周六涵盖脓毒症识别及过敏性反应，周三强调早期母体脓毒症及有用鉴别。本课通过临床决定把这些任务串起。

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:24.216
Both conditions can impair vascular tone, filling and tissue perfusion. Similar-looking shock does not mean that the first cause-specific treatment is the same.
两者都可损血管张力、充盈及组织灌注，但看似相似的休克，不代表首个病因特定治疗相同。

00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:35.160
We will distinguish screening from diagnosis, recognize danger before a late pressure collapse, and practise prompt IM epinephrine when anaphylaxis is indicated.
我们会区分筛查和诊断，在晚期血压崩溃前识别危险，并练有指征时及时肌注肾上腺素。

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:47.880
The original cases are rehearsal, not school assessment answers. Use the paired main-text and assigned examination reading without blending old and current instructions into one invented protocol.
原创病例用于排练，不是学校考核答案。应使用中英主教材及指定考试阅读，但不把旧与新指令混成自创方案。

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:59.016
An infection can be localized, but a dysregulated host response can injure organs beyond the source. You do not need proof that organisms are circulating everywhere.
感染可能局限在某来源，但失调宿主反应可损来源之外的器官，不必先证明病原体遍布循环。

00:00:59.016 --> 00:01:11.664
Sepsis concerns life-threatening organ dysfunction related to that response. New confusion, worsening breathing or poor perfusion may be more important than the temperature alone.
脓毒症关注该反应相关的致命器官功能障碍。新混乱、呼吸恶化或低灌注，可能比单独温度更重要。

00:01:11.664 --> 00:01:23.712
Fever is not required, and the cause is not restricted to gram-negative bacteria. A culture result is usually unavailable in the field and is not a prerequisite for clinical concern.
不必有发热，病因也不只革兰阴性菌。现场通常没有培养结果，而结果并非产生临床担忧的前提。

00:01:23.712 --> 00:01:35.568
A suspected source plus otherwise unexplained dysfunction needs timely evaluation. Continue to consider a noninfectious cause rather than using the sepsis label to close reasoning.
疑似来源加其他解释不足的功能异常，需要及时评估。仍需考虑非感染病因，不能用脓毒症标签结束推理。

00:01:35.568 --> 00:01:46.680
Vasodilation increases vascular capacity and can reduce effective pressure and return. Capillary leakage moves plasma fluid out of the circulation into tissues.
血管扩张增加容量空间，可降低有效压力和回流。毛细血管漏又使血浆液从循环进入组织。

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:58.080
Microvascular distribution and oxygen use may be impaired even when a cuff pressure is not yet critically low. Myocardial dysfunction can further complicate the circulation.
即使袖带压尚未危急下降，微循环分配及氧利用也可能受损；心肌障碍又可使循环更复杂。

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:09.456
Edema does not prove the vascular space is well filled. At the same time, a poorly perfused edematous patient is not automatically a candidate for unlimited fluid.
水肿不能证明血管内充盈足够；同时，低灌注伴水肿者也不自动适合无限补液。

00:02:09.456 --> 00:02:20.424
This is a mechanism for reassessment, not a rigid warm-then-cold shock timetable. Use the actual function, flow clues and response to guide the next decision.
这个机制用于复评，不是固定先暖后冷的休克时间表。需用真实功能、血流线索和反应指导下一决定。

00:02:20.424 --> 00:02:30.552
Ask what the patient could do yesterday and what changed today. New confusion or inability to manage usual tasks can be a meaningful early change.
应问昨天能做什么、今天变了什么。新混乱或无法完成平常任务，可能就是重要早期变化。

00:02:30.552 --> 00:02:44.472
Assess breathing rate, depth, effort, air movement and oxygenation, not only saturation. Organ dysfunction can present as a respiratory problem before hypotension is obvious.
需评呼吸频率深度、功、气流及氧合，不能只看血氧。器官障碍可在明显低压前，先以呼吸问题呈现。

00:02:44.472 --> 00:02:56.160
Compare peripheral perfusion, pulses and pressure trends. A warm appearance does not establish safety, and cool or mottled skin is not a required late-stage sequence.
需比较外周灌注、脉搏及血压趋势。皮肤暖不证明安全，冷或花斑也不是必须依次出现的晚期顺序。

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:09.336
Reduced urine output can add concern, but not every AKI is oliguric and a field estimate is imperfect. Preserve the history and uncertainty rather than claiming a laboratory diagnosis.
尿量减少可增加担忧，但并非所有AKI都少尿，现场估计也不精确。应保留病史和不确定，不能冒称化验诊断。

00:03:09.336 --> 00:03:19.080
The school specifically asks you to recognize early SIRS findings. Learn the criteria accurately and say which observations are actually available.
学校明确要求识别早期SIRS发现。需准确学标准，并说出哪些观察真正可得。

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:30.816
SIRS can occur with infection, but also with trauma, burns or pancreatitis. Two inflammatory findings do not by themselves prove the infectious cause or severity.
SIRS可见于感染，也可见于创伤、烧伤或胰腺炎。两项炎症发现本身，不能证明感染病因或严重度。

00:03:30.816 --> 00:03:40.872
The Nancy SIRS-plus-infection formula is historical diagnostic wording. It should not replace current recognition of infection-associated organ dysfunction.
Nancy中SIRS加感染公式属于历史诊断措辞，不能替代现行感染相关器官异常的识别。

00:03:40.872 --> 00:03:51.432
Use the exercise to notice change earlier, not to wait until two perfect boxes or a laboratory result are available before addressing a deteriorating patient.
应把练习用于更早发现变化，而不是等两个完美方框或化验齐了，才处理恶化患者。

00:03:51.432 --> 00:03:59.544
The directly read Nancy criteria include temperature above thirty-eight or below thirty-six, and heart rate above ninety per minute.
直接阅读的Nancy标准包括体温高于38或低于36℃，以及心率大于每分钟90次。

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:11.184
The respiratory criterion is a rate above twenty or arterial carbon dioxide below thirty-two. An end-tidal reading is not automatically the same as that arterial criterion.
呼吸条件为频率大于20，或动脉二氧化碳低于32。呼气末读数不能自动等同该动脉条件。

00:04:11.184 --> 00:04:23.064
The book white-cell line is above twelve or below four times ten to the ninth per liter. Other standard versions may add immature cells; never invent an unavailable field count.
书中白细胞行为大于12或小于4乘10的9次方每升。其他标准版本可能加幼稚细胞，但绝不能编现场没有的计数。

00:04:23.064 --> 00:04:34.368
State the observed components and whether the historical two-or-more screen is met. Missing data remain unknown, and the result still needs cause and organ-function assessment.
应说已观察项目及是否达到历史两项或以上筛查。缺失仍是未知，结果仍需病因及器官功能评估。

00:04:34.368 --> 00:04:46.008
A low score cannot safely overrule new dysfunction or a worrying trend. A high score may be caused by another disease and is not an automatic sepsis diagnosis.
低分不能安全推翻新功能异常或危险趋势，高分也可能由其他疾病引起，不会自动确诊脓毒症。

00:04:46.008 --> 00:04:58.440
The selected twenty-twenty-six SSC guidance supports standardized prehospital screening and cautions against sole qSOFA use for hospital screening. It does not turn qSOFA into a rule-out.
选读2026 SSC支持标准院前筛查，并警惕医院只用qSOFA筛查；它不会把qSOFA变成排除法。

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:09.648
Likewise, one normal lactate or biomarker does not prove absence of disease. A raised value can reflect more than one mechanism and requires interpretation.
同样，一个正常乳酸或标志不能证明无病，升高也可能有多种机制，需要解释。

00:05:09.648 --> 00:05:18.336
If the patient worries you, repeat the assessment, seek support and communicate the concern even when the formal score seems reassuring.
患者让你担心时，即使正式分数看似放心，也需重复评估、寻支援并传达担忧。

00:05:18.336 --> 00:05:31.320
In the intended adult population, use the approved chart and measure each physiological component. Include oxygen use and the correct saturation scale rather than calculating from an incomplete row.
在适用成人中，应使用获准表，测全部生理项目，含氧疗及正确血氧量表，不能拿不完整一行计算。

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:41.952
New confusion is a major finding even if the patient opens eyes and talks. Do not call the consciousness score normal merely because conversation is possible.
即使患者睁眼说话，新混乱仍是重要发现。不能只因可以交谈，就把意识项目记正常。

00:05:41.952 --> 00:05:55.152
A single component scoring three can matter even when the total is not extreme. The scoring and response principles from Week One remain, with local service actions distinguished from hospital staffing intervals.
即使总分不极高，单项三分也重要。第一周的评分反应原则仍适用，但需区分当地机构行动与医院人员响应间隔。

00:05:55.152 --> 00:06:06.072
Record the component values with the total so the receiving team can interpret the change. A score without measurements, time or treatment context is weak communication.
总分应与各项数值一起记录，让接收方能解释变化。没有测量、时刻和治疗背景的分数，沟通价值很弱。

00:06:06.072 --> 00:06:19.968
The original RCP recommendations exclude children under sixteen and pregnant patients, while a FAQ discusses a twenty-week boundary. That wording difference is not proof of universal obstetric validation.
RCP原始建议排除16岁以下及孕妇，而FAQ又谈20周边界。这个措辞差异，不证明通用产科适用已获验证。

00:06:19.968 --> 00:06:30.456
K zero two uses broader all-patient wording. Do not resolve the difference by inventing a low-score clearance for a pregnant or recently postpartum patient.
K02使用更宽的所有患者措辞。不能用自创的孕妇或近期产后低分放行法来解决差异。

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:42.792
The source tool reserves saturation scale two for the appropriate clinician-selected hypercapnic respiratory-failure context. It is not automatically selected from every COPD label.
原工具的第二血氧量表用于适当临床选择的高碳酸呼衰背景，不是每个COPD标签就自动选用。

00:06:42.792 --> 00:06:54.576
Use the actual local maternity assessment and consultation process. Physiology, source symptoms, organ function and clinical concern remain essential regardless of the score.
需使用真实当地母体评估和咨询流程。不论分数如何，生理、感染源症状、器官功能及临床担忧仍是关键。

00:06:54.576 --> 00:07:06.216
Check glucose in suspected sepsis and altered function. Treat confirmed hypoglycemia through the actual airway-safe pathway, then repeat glucose and the clinical assessment.
疑脓毒症及功能变化时需查血糖。确认低糖后，依真实保护气道路径处理，再复测糖及临床情况。

00:07:06.216 --> 00:07:15.720
A high glucose without known diabetes may be a stress clue, but it does not identify infection or eliminate DKA and other alternatives.
无已知糖尿病者高糖，可能是应激线索，却不能确定感染，也不能排DKA及其他鉴别。

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:27.696
Lactate can reflect several processes, including altered production and clearance. It is not a direct meter of one patient universal oxygen debt or a sepsis-only result.
乳酸可反映多种过程，包括生成及清除变化，不是测某人普遍氧债的直接仪表，也不专属于脓毒症。

00:07:27.696 --> 00:07:38.928
Use only actually available authorized tests. A normal result does not cancel worsening function, and collecting a test must not delay necessary support or conveyance.
只能使用真正可得且获准的检测。正常结果不能取消功能恶化担忧，采样也不能延误必要支持或转运。

00:07:38.928 --> 00:07:51.240
Ask focused questions about respiratory, urinary, abdominal and skin symptoms, recent procedures, devices and treatment. A suspected source should fit the time course.
应重点问呼吸、泌尿、腹部和皮肤症状、近期操作、器械及治疗，疑似来源需符合病程。

00:07:51.240 --> 00:08:02.712
Malodorous urine alone does not establish a urinary infection. Similarly, a visible wound is not proof that it explains every neurological or circulatory finding.
单有臭尿不能确定尿路感染；同样，可见伤口也不证明能解释全部神经或循环发现。

00:08:02.712 --> 00:08:15.096
Examine for mottling, non-blanching rash or rapidly progressive painful tissue changes where indicated, with appropriate consent and PPE. Do not require a rash for recognition.
有指征时需在适当同意和PPE下，查花斑、不褪色疹或快速进展的疼痛组织变化；识别并不强求皮疹。

00:08:15.096 --> 00:08:26.208
Ask about antipyretics and antimicrobials, prior results and access barriers without blame. Current treatment does not guarantee that a new serious infection is controlled.
需不责备地问退热抗菌药、既往结果及获取障碍。已在治疗，不保证新的严重感染已受控制。

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:37.056
A fifty-one-year-old with a worsening hand wound after a repair workshop is now confused and cannot follow familiar tasks. The temperature is thirty-six point three.
一位51岁者修理工作坊后手部伤口恶化，现在混乱且无法完成熟悉任务，体温36.3℃。

00:08:37.056 --> 00:08:48.672
Pulse is one hundred eighteen, respiratory rate twenty-six, pressure one hundred four over sixty-six, saturation ninety-six on room air and glucose six point eight.
脉搏118、呼吸26、血压104/66、室内空气血氧96%，血糖6.8。

00:08:48.672 --> 00:08:59.040
The absence of fever does not explain away the new dysfunction. A possible infectious source, rapid breathing and altered function require urgent assessment.
没有发热不能消除新功能异常。可能感染源、呼吸快及功能改变，需紧急评估。

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:11.136
Keep other causes open, including neurological, toxic or metabolic illness. This is suspected infection-related dysfunction, not a field-confirmed culture diagnosis.
仍需保留神经、毒性或代谢等其他原因。这里是疑似感染相关功能异常，不是现场培养确诊。

00:09:11.136 --> 00:09:22.968
In the historical SIRS exercise, the observed pulse and breathing rate are positive; the temperature is not and the white-cell count is unknown. Do not invent the missing count.
历史SIRS练习中，已测脉率和呼吸为阳性，体温不符合，白细胞未知。不能编造缺失计数。

00:09:22.968 --> 00:09:37.416
For this nonpregnant adult using scale one, NEWS two is nine: three for breathing, one for pressure, two for pulse and three for new confusion. The remaining measured components and room air add zero.
本非孕成人用第一量表，NEWS2为九：呼吸三、血压一、脉搏二、新混乱三，其余已测项目及室内空气为零。

00:09:37.416 --> 00:09:50.016
The score supports deterioration concern, but the clinical change was already enough to act. Do not wait until systolic pressure falls below ninety before organizing support and conveyance.
分数支持恶化担忧，但临床变化本已足够促进行动。不能等收缩压低于90才组织支持和转运。

00:09:50.016 --> 00:10:00.936
Report the possible source, new functional change, actual measurements and response. Reassess the patient rather than simply repeating the number nine to every team member.
应报可能来源、新功能变化、真实测量及反应，并复评患者，而非只向每个队员重复“九分”。

00:10:00.936 --> 00:10:12.624
Support the actual airway and ventilation problems immediately. Oxygen should meet the applicable patient/pathway target, not a generic all-patient high-flow ritual.
需立即支持真实气道及通气问题。氧疗应满足适用患者路径目标，不是所有人高流量的仪式。

00:10:12.624 --> 00:10:23.904
Do not walk a poorly perfused patient. Use a position suited to circulation and breathing, protect against heat loss where appropriate and avoid unnecessary exertion.
不要让低灌注者步行。体位需兼顾循环和呼吸，适当防失温，并避免不必要用力。

00:10:23.904 --> 00:10:35.832
If pressure support is considered, its own eligibility and contraindications still apply. The word sepsis does not make every hypoxic or hypotensive patient suitable for CPAP.
考虑压力支持时，其自身适应禁忌仍需满足。脓毒症一词，不会让每个低氧或低压者都适合CPAP。

00:10:35.832 --> 00:10:46.896
Assign someone to repeat observations and call out change while egress and receiving arrangements proceed. Do not finish a perfect checklist while the main threat worsens.
准备撤离接收时，应明确人员重复观察并报变化。不能在主要威胁恶化时，还追求完美清单。

00:10:46.896 --> 00:10:58.248
Obtain indicated access and use the actual service fluid plan. The patient may be depleted even with chronic edema, but that does not remove the risk of overload.
需取得有指征通路并使用真实机构液体计划。即使慢性水肿也可能容量不足，但不能因此忽略过量风险。

00:10:58.248 --> 00:11:09.720
Assess the response frequently: mentation, pulse, pressure, skin and breathing. New respiratory worsening or edema needs immediate review of the plan.
需频繁评反应：意识、脉搏、血压、皮肤和呼吸。新呼吸恶化或水肿，需要立即重新审视计划。

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:21.960
International adult or maternal volume examples are not automatic ordinary PCP orders. Do not force one fixed amount on every renal, cardiac or pregnant patient.
国际成人或母体液量例，不是普通PCP自动医嘱。不能给每个肾病、心脏病或孕妇强套同一固定量。

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:34.392
Persistent shock needs early qualified assistance, not endless repeated fluid without a response assessment. Continue timely conveyance and notification rather than waiting for a bag to finish.
持续休克需要尽早合资格协助，而非不评反应地无止境重复补液。应继续及时转运预警，不能等输液袋空。

00:11:34.392 --> 00:11:46.632
Antimicrobial treatment and source control address the infection itself. Early communication can help the receiving team prepare those resources without waiting for a formal field confirmation.
抗菌及感染源控制处理感染本身。尽早沟通可帮助接收团队准备资源，不必等正式现场确诊。

00:11:46.632 --> 00:11:58.560
The selected twenty-twenty-six SSC statements distinguish levels of infection likelihood and shock, rather than giving every possible infection the same automatic antibiotic clock.
选读2026 SSC区分感染可能度和休克，并非给每个可能感染都套相同自动抗菌时钟。

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:13.584
Its prehospital antibiotic suggestion requires a structured program, appropriate shock context and prolonged time to medical evaluation. It does not authorize an ordinary BC PCP to select independent antibiotics.
其院前抗菌建议要求结构化项目、适当休克背景及到医学评估时间较长，不授权普通BC PCP独立选择抗菌药。

00:12:13.584 --> 00:12:27.384
State suspected infection, the organ/perfusion problem, relevant history, actual treatment and response, ETA and any capability request. That useful alert is within the current task now.
应报疑似感染、器官灌注问题、相关病史、真实治疗反应、到达时间及所需能力。做这样有用的预警，是当前就能执行的任务。

00:12:27.384 --> 00:12:39.816
A thirty-nine-year-old ten days after delivery had been recovering, but now has new confusion, increasing pelvic pain and abnormal discharge. Temperature is thirty-eight point four.
一位39岁者分娩十天后原本在恢复，现在新混乱、盆腔疼痛加重并有异常分泌物，体温38.4℃。

00:12:39.816 --> 00:12:51.648
Pulse is one hundred twenty-six, breathing twenty-six and pressure one hundred ten over seventy. Do not dismiss the pattern as normal postpartum physiology or wait for shock.
脉搏126、呼吸26、血压110/70。不能把此模式轻率叫正常产后生理，也不能等休克。

00:12:51.648 --> 00:13:05.760
Support current threats, check glucose and evaluate bleeding, neurological/hypertensive findings and possible source. Use the actual maternity pathway rather than a generic score as clearance.
应支持当前威胁、查糖，并评出血、神经高血压发现及可能来源。需用真实母体路径，不能用通用分数放行。

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:17.112
A working maternal-sepsis concern needs early notification, while hemorrhage and other causes remain active alternatives. Preserve the delivery date and symptom-change timeline.
工作性母体脓毒症担忧需尽早预警，同时保留出血等其他原因，并保留分娩日期及症状变化时间线。

00:13:17.112 --> 00:13:28.248
Rank an alternative that could harm this patient if missed, not a list of unrelated diagnoses. Use the actual pregnancy, exposure and symptom chronology.
应给漏掉就会伤害该患者的鉴别排序，不是列无关诊断。要用真实妊娠、暴露及症状时序。

00:13:28.248 --> 00:13:39.960
A glucose measurement, bleeding check, pressure/neurological reassessment or focused exposure question can be a useful discriminator, provided it does not postpone rescue.
血糖、出血检查、血压神经复评或重点暴露问题，都可能有用，但前提是不推迟救援。

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:49.392
State why the alternative matters and what finding would alter the plan. A spoken What Else with no connection to an action is only a slogan.
需说明该鉴别为何重要，以及什么发现会改计划。只喊What Else却不联系行动，只是口号。

00:13:49.392 --> 00:14:01.728
Revisit the explanation after every meaningful change. Infection and another problem may coexist, just as anaphylaxis may produce a GI or neurological-looking complaint.
每次有意义变化后都需重审解释。感染可与另一问题并存，过敏性反应也可呈现像胃肠或神经的主诉。

00:14:01.728 --> 00:14:11.352
Anaphylaxis is an acute potentially life-threatening hypersensitivity presentation. Mediator release can affect several systems at the same time.
过敏性反应是一种急性、可能致命的超敏表现，介质释放可同时影响多个系统。

00:14:11.352 --> 00:14:22.200
Upper-airway swelling can change voice or produce stridor, while lower-airway bronchospasm and mucus impair airflow. These are related but distinct threats.
上气道肿胀可改变声音或产生喉鸣，下气道痉挛黏液则损害气流，两者相关但不同。

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:34.128
Vasodilation and plasma leakage reduce effective circulating volume and return, with possible cardiac effects. Severe compromise does not require external blood loss.
扩血管及血浆漏出减少有效循环容量回流，也可能有心脏效应。严重受损不必先有外部失血。

00:14:34.128 --> 00:14:45.000
This explains why indicated IM epinephrine and ABC support run in parallel. One bronchodilator or antihistamine cannot replace the full rescue plan.
这解释了有指征肌注肾上腺素与ABC支持为何要并行。单一支扩或抗组胺药，不能代替完整救援计划。

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:55.344
In common IgE-mediated reactions, previous sensitization prepares mast cells and basophils to release mediators when the allergen is encountered again.
常见IgE介导反应中，先前致敏使肥大和嗜碱细胞准备在再遇过敏原时释放介质。

00:14:55.344 --> 00:15:05.136
The patient may not know that sensitization occurred. A first recognized reaction or a report of no known allergy does not exclude the syndrome.
患者可能不知道曾致敏。首次识别的反应或自述无已知过敏，都不能排该综合征。

00:15:05.136 --> 00:15:15.408
Non-IgE mechanisms can produce anaphylaxis as well. Do not require a specific antibody explanation before treating an indicated clinical emergency.
非IgE机制也能产生过敏性反应。不能要求先解释特定抗体机制，才处理有指征的临床急症。

00:15:15.408 --> 00:15:28.320
Repeated exposures do not follow a guaranteed worsening staircase. Base urgency on today actual airway, breathing, circulation and progression rather than a prediction from last time.
重复暴露不保证按固定阶梯更重。需依据今天真实气道呼吸循环及进展，而非只从上次预测紧急度。

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:39.672
Ask about voice change, a throat lump or difficulty speaking and inspect relevant swelling. Stridor suggests an upper-airway threat different from a lower-airway wheeze.
应问声音变化、喉部异物感或说话困难，并查相关肿胀。喉鸣提示的上气道威胁，不同于下气道哮鸣。

00:15:39.672 --> 00:15:50.880
Assess respiratory rate, depth, work and air entry. A noisy chest may become quiet because less air moves, not because the condition has improved.
需评呼吸频率深度、功及进气。胸音从响变静，可能因气体更少，而不是病情改善。

00:15:50.880 --> 00:16:03.576
Fatigue, ineffective effort or declining consciousness requires immediate support and skilled assistance. A normal saturation at one instant must not cancel these observations.
疲劳、无效呼吸努力或意识下降，需要即时支持和熟练协助。某瞬间血氧正常，不能取消这些发现。

00:16:03.576 --> 00:16:14.496
Do not wait for a completely obstructed airway to request resources or give indicated IM treatment. Recognizing the mechanism should shorten, not lengthen, the delay.
不能等气道完全堵住才请求资源或给有指征肌注。理解机制应缩短延误，而不是拉长。

00:16:14.496 --> 00:16:26.664
Rapid vasodilation and leakage can reduce return and output. Faintness, collapse or altered function after a plausible exposure may be a circulatory emergency.
快速扩血管及漏出可降低回流输出。可能暴露后近晕、倒地或功能变化，可能就是循环急症。

00:16:26.664 --> 00:16:39.168
Skin findings may be subtle, absent, earlier than arrival or partly masked. Do not wait for a photogenic rash or a pressure below ninety before recognizing dangerous compromise.
皮肤发现可能轻微、缺失、到场前出现或部分被掩盖。不能等典型漂亮皮疹，或血压低于90才识别危险受损。

00:16:39.168 --> 00:16:50.280
The patient may also have cramping, vomiting or diarrhea. A GI chief complaint does not guarantee a GI-only cause if airway or perfusion features are developing.
患者还可能绞痛、呕吐或腹泻。若气道灌注表现正在出现，胃肠主诉并不保证只有胃肠原因。

00:16:50.280 --> 00:17:00.720
Treat the indicated syndrome while assessing other possibilities. The aim is useful early action with reassessment, not a definitive allergen diagnosis at the scene.
应在评其他可能时，处理有指征综合征。目标是有用的早期行动及复评，不是在现场确诊具体过敏原。

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:11.712
Contemporary criteria include acute skin or mucosal involvement with respiratory, circulatory or severe gastrointestinal features as one diagnostic route.
现代标准的一条识别路径，是急性皮肤或黏膜受累，加呼吸、循环或严重胃肠表现。

00:17:11.712 --> 00:17:23.232
Another route is acute hypotension, bronchospasm or laryngeal involvement after a known or highly probable allergen for that patient, even when the skin looks normal.
另一条是该患者已知或极可能过敏原后，急性低压、支气管痉挛或喉受累，即使皮肤看似正常。

00:17:23.232 --> 00:17:35.568
The public RASH mnemonic helps remember affected systems, but one isolated mild skin symptom is not automatically proof of anaphylaxis. Assess the consequence and progression.
公开RASH助记可帮助记受累系统，但单一轻皮肤症状，不自动证明过敏性反应。需评后果及进展。

00:17:35.568 --> 00:17:46.128
Criteria support early clinical recognition; they are not permission to delay care until every historical detail, rash or pressure threshold is complete.
标准用于支持早期临床识别，不是让你等病史细节、皮疹或血压阈值全齐再照护的许可。

00:17:46.128 --> 00:17:54.432
Do not require a known previous allergy. The trigger or earlier sensitization may be unknown even in a serious reaction.
不能要求必须有已知既往过敏；即使严重反应，诱因或先前致敏也可能未知。

00:17:54.432 --> 00:18:04.104
Do not require visible hives. Ask about earlier skin changes, but give the current airway, breathing and perfusion pattern its proper weight.
不能要求必须见荨麻疹。可问此前皮肤变化，但需给予当前气道、呼吸及灌注模式应有权重。

00:18:04.104 --> 00:18:13.272
Do not require hypotension below ninety. Progressive airway or respiratory compromise can make treatment urgent before that number is reached.
不能要求必须低于90。进展气道或呼吸受损，可在达到该数字前就使治疗紧急。

00:18:13.272 --> 00:18:22.656
Keep a useful alternative in mind without delaying the indicated action. Improvement or lack of improvement after treatment must trigger another assessment.
应保留有用鉴别，但不延误有指征行动。治疗后改善或不改善，都需触发再次评估。

00:18:22.656 --> 00:18:34.800
For recognized anaphylaxis, IM epinephrine is the first-line medication. Give it promptly through the verified local route and authorization while ABC support continues.
已识别过敏性反应时，肌注肾上腺素是一线药。需在ABC支持持续时，依核实当地途径权限及时给入。

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:43.944
Assign work in parallel so drawing up an IV line or attaching the monitor does not postpone the first indicated IM dose.
应并行分工，不能让准备静脉通路或接监护，推迟首个有指征肌注剂量。

00:18:43.944 --> 00:18:55.008
Antihistamines and bronchodilators do not provide the same rescue. Choosing a less alarming-looking drug first can leave the vascular or upper-airway threat untreated.
抗组胺和支扩药不能提供相同救援。先选看似没那么强的药，可能让血管或上气道威胁持续未治。

00:18:55.008 --> 00:19:04.584
A cardiovascular history deserves monitoring and care, not automatic withholding of indicated IM epinephrine in a life-threatening situation.
心血管病史值得监测谨慎，但在致命情况下，不能自动因此拒绝有指征肌注肾上腺素。

00:19:04.584 --> 00:19:14.352
Alpha-adrenergic effects support vascular tone and reduce mucosal swelling. These effects matter when return and airway caliber are threatened.
α肾上腺素效应支持血管张力、减少黏膜肿胀，在回流和气道口径受威胁时很重要。

00:19:14.352 --> 00:19:23.448
Beta-one effects support the heart, while beta-two effects relax bronchial smooth muscle. This is more than treatment of an itchy rash.
β1效应支持心脏，β2效应松弛支气管平滑肌。这远不只是治疗发痒皮疹。

00:19:23.448 --> 00:19:33.288
Epinephrine also limits mediator effects and release. An H-one antihistamine cannot reproduce this combined airway and circulatory action.
肾上腺素还限制介质效应释放。H1抗组胺药不能重现这种气道和循环合并作用。

00:19:33.288 --> 00:19:44.160
Use the mechanism to predict useful endpoints: better voice/airflow, effective breathing and improved perfusion, while monitoring adverse effects and recurrence.
应借机制预测有用终点：声音气流更好、呼吸有效、灌注改善，并持续监测不良作用及复发。

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:58.776
The checked local adult anaphylaxis schedule is zero point five milligrams IM every five minutes, with its stated repeat instructions. Reassess and follow the actual current protocol rather than invent a dose ceiling.
核对当地成人过敏性反应方案为0.5mg肌注每5分钟，并有其明示重复要求。应复评并依真实现行方案，不能自创剂量上限。

00:19:58.776 --> 00:20:09.768
Pediatric anaphylaxis is weight based at zero point zero one milligrams per kilogram, maximum zero point five milligrams, through the actual pediatric pathway.
儿科过敏性反应按体重0.01mg/kg，最大0.5mg，需依真实儿科路径执行。

00:20:09.768 --> 00:20:21.864
The preferred site is the anterolateral middle thigh. The textbook five-to-fifteen-minute interval and pediatric zero point three maximum are not silently merged into the current local schedule.
优先点为大腿前外侧中段。教材5至15分钟间隔及儿科0.3mg上限，不能悄悄混进现行当地方案。

00:20:21.864 --> 00:20:35.040
IM anaphylaxis, severe-bronchospasm treatment and advanced cardiac-arrest IV or IO epinephrine are different indications and routes. A shared drug name does not make them interchangeable.
肌注过敏性反应、严重支痉挛及高级骤停静脉骨内肾上腺素，指征途径不同。药名相同，不代表可互换。

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:45.288
For this preparation exercise, the correct adult IM pathway calls for zero point five milligrams and the actual label says one milligram per milliliter.
本配制练习中，正确成人肌注路径要求0.5mg，而真实标签为1mg/mL。

00:20:45.288 --> 00:20:57.360
Divide the mass by the concentration: zero point five milligrams divided by one milligram per milliliter equals zero point five milliliters. State both mass and volume.
质量除浓度：0.5mg除以1mg/mL，等于0.5mL。需同时说出质量和体积。

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:09.720
Use the label in milligrams per milliliter, not only old ratio notation. A zero point one milligram-per-milliliter arrest syringe is ten times more dilute and is not the same product.
应使用标签mg/mL，不只靠旧比例记法。0.1mg/mL骤停针筒稀十倍，并非同一产品。

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:22.440
Complete the independent check required by the actual process. Do not import the inconsistent advanced-IV dilution paragraph from the book or give the IM preparation as an IV bolus.
需完成真实流程要求的独立核查。不能引入书中不一致的高级静脉稀释段，也不能把肌注配制当静脉推注。

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:31.296
Ask whether the patient or a helper used an autoinjector, and establish the actual product, dose if known, time and response.
应问患者或旁人是否已用自动笔，明确真实产品、已知剂量、时间和反应。

00:21:31.296 --> 00:21:40.680
That dose is part of the same treatment course. Do not reset the medication clock at crew arrival or omit it from the record and receiving report.
该剂量属于同一治疗过程，不能到场就重设用药计时，也不能从记录交接中漏掉。

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:52.200
Follow the actual device instructions rather than assuming every model has the same fixed dose or hold time. Identify what supply remains without postponing indicated care.
需依真实装置说明，不能假定每型固定剂量或保持时间相同。应了解余量，但不推迟有指征照护。

00:21:52.200 --> 00:22:05.688
A previous reaction, exposure without symptoms or a personalized rescue plan needs context. Do not turn the textbook example into a universal instruction to inject every asymptomatic exposure.
既往反应、尚无症状暴露或个人救援计划，都需要背景。不能把教材例变成每次无症状暴露都注射的通用指令。

00:22:05.688 --> 00:22:17.424
Avoid standing or walking during anaphylaxis. Sudden upright movement can further reduce venous return when vascular tone and circulating volume are already compromised.
过敏性反应中应避免站立步行。血管张力和循环容量受损时，突然直立会进一步减少回流。

00:22:17.424 --> 00:22:27.768
Use a circulation-supporting supine position when tolerated, with a suitable supported modification if severe breathing difficulty or vomiting makes that unsafe.
可耐受时用仰卧支持循环；若严重呼吸困难或呕吐使之不安全，应作适当有支撑改良。

00:22:27.768 --> 00:22:38.208
Pregnancy may require a suitable left-sided position or compression-relief plan. Do not force one posture at the expense of effective breathing or airway protection.
妊娠可能需合适左侧位或减压计划，不能为强求单一姿势牺牲有效呼吸或气道保护。

00:22:38.208 --> 00:22:49.752
Plan a coordinated stretcher movement, keep treatment available and reassess immediately afterward. The fact that the patient feels better is not permission to walk to the ambulance.
应计划协调担架搬动、保持治疗可用并在搬后立即复评。患者觉得好些，不是让其走去救护车的许可。

00:22:49.752 --> 00:23:01.008
Give oxygen and support ventilation according to the actual clinical problem. A mask with oxygen flow does not prove adequate tidal movement or carbon-dioxide clearance.
需依真实临床问题给氧及支持通气。面罩有氧流，不证明潮气移动或二氧化碳清除足够。

00:23:01.008 --> 00:23:13.128
If assisted ventilation is needed, use appropriate airway position, seal, adjuncts and help. Monitor actual chest movement and response rather than squeeze rate alone.
需要辅助通气时，应适当摆气道、密封、用辅助并求协助。需看真实胸动和反应，不只数挤囊率。

00:23:13.128 --> 00:23:24.840
Obstructed lungs need adequate exhalation. Forceful rapid bagging can worsen air trapping, gastric distension, vomiting, pressure injury and hypotension.
阻塞肺需足够呼气。用力快速挤囊，可能加重气体潴留、胃胀、呕吐、压力损伤及低血压。

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:39.192
Seek skilled airway resources early when swelling or fatigue makes support ineffective. Advanced or surgical airway discussion does not create independent PCP authority or replace IM epinephrine.
肿胀疲劳使支持无效时，应尽早求熟练气道资源。高级手术气道讨论不增加PCP独立权限，也不能替代肌注肾上腺素。

00:23:39.192 --> 00:23:47.904
Salbutamol can help persistent bronchospasm after epinephrine, but it does not provide the same vascular or upper-airway effects.
沙丁胺醇可帮助处理肾上腺素后持续支气管痉挛，但不具同样血管或上气道效应。

00:23:47.904 --> 00:24:02.160
Diphenhydramine may improve urticaria, not life-threatening airway or circulatory failure. Current E zero nine and the monograph place it at ACP, unlike the saved examination page PCP heading.
苯海拉明可能改善荨麻疹，却不能救致命气道循环失败。现行E09专论列ACP，与保存考试页的PCP标题不同。

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:14.232
Steroids act slowly and routine prevention of biphasic reactions is unproven. Neither an antihistamine nor a steroid justifies delaying epinephrine or declaring the patient safe.
激素作用慢，常规预防双相反应获益未证。抗组胺或激素都不能成为延误肾上腺素或宣布安全的理由。

00:24:14.232 --> 00:24:25.776
Treat residual symptoms through the actual authorized plan and keep reassessing the main threats. Persistent skin itch alone is not equivalent to persistent circulatory collapse.
剩余症状应依真实获准计划处理，并持续重评主要威胁。仅皮痒持续，不等同循环仍崩溃。

00:24:25.776 --> 00:24:37.392
An inadequate response requires another complete assessment. Confirm what medicine actually reached the patient, the dose, route and time, including earlier autoinjector treatment.
反应不足需再次完整评估。应确认真正到患者的药、剂量、途径时间，包括此前自动笔治疗。

00:24:37.392 --> 00:24:51.048
Repeat the ABC and perfusion examination and consider ongoing exposure or a competing diagnosis. Do not assume that silence, sedation or a slightly better saturation means recovery.
需重做ABC和灌注检查，并考虑持续暴露或竞争诊断。不能把无声、镇静或血氧略好当恢复。

00:24:51.048 --> 00:25:02.712
Follow the permitted repeat IM pathway with indicated fluids and respiratory support. Call for advanced help early rather than improvising an IV epinephrine bolus.
需依获准重复肌注路径，结合有指征液体和呼吸支持。应尽早求高级协助，不能即兴静脉推肾上腺素。

00:25:02.712 --> 00:25:18.288
The textbook advanced glucagon and IV dilution passages contain unsafe unit or concentration problems. They are not rescue recipes, and beta-blocker history does not create a new ordinary PCP glucagon indication.
教材高级胰高血糖素及静脉稀释段有不安全单位浓度问题，不能当救援配方；β阻滞史也不形成普通PCP新胰高血糖素指征。

00:25:18.288 --> 00:25:27.672
Sepsis and anaphylaxis can both produce distributive circulatory failure, but their history and immediate cause-specific decisions differ.
脓毒症和过敏性反应都可造成分布性循环失败，但病史及即时病因特定决定不同。

00:25:27.672 --> 00:25:38.616
Do not give an IM anaphylaxis regimen to every septic patient because the pressure is low, or postpone epinephrine in anaphylaxis while searching for an infection source.
不能因为低压就给每个脓毒患者肌注过敏性反应方案，也不能在过敏性反应时为查感染源而推迟肾上腺素。

00:25:38.616 --> 00:25:50.544
Bleeding, cardiac or obstructive shock, glucose problems and toxins may overlap the presentation. Select a useful alternative and a discriminator that can alter care.
出血、心源或梗阻休克、血糖及毒物，都可能与表现重叠。应选有用鉴别及能改变照护的区分观察。

00:25:50.544 --> 00:26:02.976
The shared discipline is immediate support, accurate data, action-response reassessment and early appropriate destination planning, not forcing one diagnosis to fit every finding.
共同纪律是即时支持、准确资料、行动反应复评及尽早适当目的地计划，而不是强迫一个诊断解释所有发现。

00:26:02.976 --> 00:26:58.368
Read the naloxone rows by route. The recovered March copy has a separate three-milligram intranasal entry; the June 2026 copy says four milligrams intranasally. Three milligrams is not a cumulative maximum or an intravenous dose. Its separate IM/IV sequence is 0.4, 0.4, 0.8 and 2.0 milligrams at the stated reassessment intervals. Original arithmetic: all four amounts sum to 3.6 milligrams, not four equal 0.4-milligram doses. The current adult PCP monograph uses those four escalating amounts every three minutes as needed and requires CliniCall before further doses. Route, actual product and response still matter; keep breathing support in parallel and never infer pediatric permission from this adult schedule.
按途径读纳洛酮各行：找回的3月副本有独立3mg鼻内条目，2026年6月版写4mg鼻内；3mg不是累积总量上限，也不是静脉剂量。另列肌注静脉序列为0.4、0.4、0.8、2.0mg，结合所写复评间隔。原创算术：四次合计3.6mg，不是四次相同0.4mg。现行成人PCP专论按需每3分钟用这四个递增量，更多剂量前须CliniCall。途径、实际产品及反应仍重要，要并行支持呼吸，也不能从成人序列推出儿科权限。

00:26:58.368 --> 00:27:57.408
For nitrate, the March copy ties a dose to the patient prescription strength, requires oversight without a prescription, uses a strict pressure greater than 110 for repeats and describes three doses in thirty minutes. The later exam copy states 0.4 milligrams sublingually; current BCEHS adult ACS instructions use 0.4 every three to five minutes, pressure at least 110 and heart rate 50 to 150, with CliniCall before use without a prior prescription or beyond three doses. Original comparison: a reliable systolic value of exactly 110 does not meet an old greater-than-110 rule, even though it meets the current numerical minimum. It still does not establish the indication, other exclusions or authority. The source restart-after-pain-relief note is not permission to reset a generic dose clock.
硝酸酯方面，3月副本按患者处方强度给一剂，无处方需监督，重复时严格要求血压大于110，并描述30分钟三剂。后版考试写0.4mg舌下；现行BCEHS成人ACS指令为每3至5分钟0.4mg、收缩压至少110及心率50至150，无既往处方或超过三剂前须CliniCall。原创比较：可靠收缩压恰好110不符合旧“大于110”，虽达现行数字下限，仍不证明指征、其他排除或权限。来源疼痛缓解后重新开始的注释，不是可自行重置通用剂量时钟的许可。

00:27:57.408 --> 00:28:05.808
At an outdoor pottery fair, a twenty-one-year-old develops throat tightness, a hoarse voice and wheeze shortly after an insect sting.
户外陶艺市集中，一位21岁者被昆虫蜇后不久，迅速出现喉紧、嘶哑及哮鸣。

00:28:05.808 --> 00:28:17.880
Pulse is one hundred twenty-two, pressure one hundred eight over seventy and breathing work is increasing. No obvious hives are seen and there is no previous diagnosed allergy.
脉搏122、血压108/70，呼吸功正在增加；未见明显荨麻疹，也无既往已诊过敏。

00:28:17.880 --> 00:28:28.320
The acute exposure-associated airway and breathing pattern is concerning even without rash or systolic pressure below ninety. Do not wait for those missing findings.
即使无皮疹或收缩压低于90，这种急性暴露相关气道呼吸模式仍很可疑，不能等缺失征象出现。

00:28:28.320 --> 00:28:39.528
Recognize the indicated anaphylaxis pathway while assessing the immediate airway and circulation. A statement of no known allergies does not close that pathway.
应在评即时气道循环时识别有指征过敏性反应路径。“无已知过敏”一句不能关闭路径。

00:28:39.528 --> 00:28:52.680
Organize prompt verified IM epinephrine and ABC support in parallel, request appropriate help and prepare safe egress. Do not make IV access a condition for the first IM dose.
应并行组织及时核实肌注肾上腺素及ABC支持，请求适当帮助并准备安全撤离。不能把静脉成功作为首剂肌注条件。

00:28:52.680 --> 00:29:02.976
Use a suitable supported position and prevent standing or walking. If removing the ongoing trigger is feasible, do it promptly without delaying rescue.
需使用适当有支撑体位，防站立步行。可移除持续诱因时应及时做，但不延误救援。

00:29:02.976 --> 00:29:16.728
After treatment, compare voice, airway swelling, air entry, work, mentation and perfusion with timed observations. A smaller rash is not the main endpoint in this case.
治疗后需计时比较声音、气道肿胀、进气、呼吸功、意识和灌注。本例主要终点不是皮疹变小。

00:29:16.728 --> 00:29:29.952
Repeat or escalate through the actual pathway if compromise persists. Convey and prenotify despite improvement, including every dose and response rather than only saying allergic reaction treated.
受损持续时，应依真实路径重复或升级。即使好转也应转运预警，报每次剂量反应，而非只说“过敏已治”。

00:29:29.952 --> 00:29:39.936
Ask what actually changed after the intervention, with real observations and timing. A treatment completed is not automatically a treatment that worked.
需问干预后实际变了什么，并有真实观察时刻。治疗做完，不自动等于治疗有效。

00:29:39.936 --> 00:29:49.776
Predict the desired change from the mechanism: better airflow or perfusion after indicated epinephrine, for example, not merely a different pulse number.
应从机制预测所需变化，例如有指征肾上腺素后气流或灌注更好，而不只是脉搏数字不同。

00:29:49.776 --> 00:30:01.296
Look deliberately for worsening breathing, pressure, consciousness, vomiting, recurrence or a delivery error. A quieter patient can be improving or failing.
需刻意查呼吸、血压、意识恶化，呕吐、复发或给药错误。患者更安静，既可能改善也可能失败。

00:30:01.296 --> 00:30:12.240
Then choose whether to continue, modify, stop or escalate. State the evidence for that next decision so the crew and receiving team can follow the reasoning.
再选继续、调整、停止或升级，并说明证据，让队友及接收团队跟得上推理。

00:30:12.240 --> 00:30:33.912
The assigned article links emergency readiness to reliable medication supplies. Verify the actual product, expiry, storage, delivery device and trained role before use. An older US syringe-kit program is not permission to improvise a replacement, change concentrations or reduce a dose by half without authority.
指定文章把急救准备与可靠药品供应连接。使用前须核真实产品、有效期、储存、给药装置及受训角色。旧美国针筒项目不允许自行替代、改变浓度或未经授权把剂量减半。

00:30:33.912 --> 00:30:54.408
If a patient does not improve, reassess airway, breathing, perfusion, actual delivery and the continuing reaction. Do not infer a single cause from expiry alone or delay the current repeat and escalation pathway while debating the device. Record what was actually given and how the patient responded.
患者不改善时，应复评气道、呼吸、灌注、真实送达及持续反应。不能仅凭有效期推断单一原因，也不能因争论装置而延误现行重复及升级路径。需记录真实给药及患者反应。

00:30:54.408 --> 00:31:07.032
Lead with suspected cause and the actual threat: infection with new dysfunction, or exposure-associated airway and circulatory compromise, rather than a long background narrative.
应先报疑似原因和真实威胁：感染伴新功能异常，或暴露相关气道循环受损，而非先讲长背景。

00:31:07.032 --> 00:31:19.536
Give the relevant timeline and current measured findings. For maternal illness include the actual delivery or loss date; for anaphylaxis include self-treatment and every epinephrine dose.
需报相关时间线及当前测量。母体病含真实分娩丢失日期，过敏性反应含自救及每次肾上腺素剂量。

00:31:19.536 --> 00:31:30.984
State what was actually delivered and the response, including persistent concerns. Do not turn a working syndrome into a confirmed culture result or confirmed allergen diagnosis.
应说真正实施的照护及反应，包括持续担忧。不能把工作综合征说成培养确诊或已确认过敏原。

00:31:30.984 --> 00:31:42.672
Include ETA, needed capability and a clear request, then verify understanding using the current transfer or consultation structure. Match the same facts in the PCR.
需含到达时间、所需能力及清楚请求，再用现行交接咨询结构确认理解，PCR保留相同事实。

00:31:42.672 --> 00:31:53.904
Use an observer to reveal only the information actually obtained. The crew must request missing history or perform the relevant assessment rather than assume normal findings.
可由观察者只揭示真正取得的信息，团队需问缺病史或做相关评估，不能假定正常。

00:31:53.904 --> 00:32:06.864
Introduce one changing variable, such as new hypotension, persistent aphasia after glucose correction or wheeze after an exposure history. Say what it changes and what remains uncertain.
每次引入一个变量，如新低压、纠糖后仍失语，或暴露史后哮鸣。需说它改变什么、什么仍不确定。

00:32:06.864 --> 00:32:17.064
Practise clear medication mass, concentration, volume and route checks with trainer supplies, plus non-walking movement and repeated observations.
应以训练用品练清楚的药物质量、浓度、体积、途径核查，同时练不步行搬动及重复观察。

00:32:17.064 --> 00:32:28.608
Debrief a specific decision or communication gap and repeat the changed process. Actual injection, airway or movement competence still requires the school practical observer.
复盘一个具体决策或沟通缺口，再重练改变后的流程。真实注射、气道或搬动能力，仍需学校实体观察者考核。

00:32:28.608 --> 00:32:38.904
You should now explain why sepsis may be concerning before fever or a critical pressure appears, and use the school SIRS exercise without calling it the modern definition.
现在应能解释为什么发热或危急血压出现前就可能担忧脓毒症，并使用学校SIRS练习而不把它当现代定义。

00:32:38.904 --> 00:32:51.624
You should recognize anaphylaxis with the appropriate clinical pattern even when skin findings or previous allergy history are absent, and avoid labelling isolated mild hives as the same emergency.
应能在适当临床模式下识别无皮肤或既往过敏史的过敏性反应，同时不把单独轻荨麻疹当同一急症。

00:32:51.624 --> 00:33:04.968
Deliver the indicated treatment through the actual safe route and authority, support ABCs, move safely and evaluate the response. Setup tasks and adjuncts must not steal the priority.
需经真实安全途径权限给有指征治疗，支持ABC、安全搬动并评反应。设置任务和辅助药不能抢走优先。

00:33:04.968 --> 00:33:17.808
Continue with the school toxicology, renal, gastrointestinal and endocrine requirements. The paired reading supports this workshop but does not certify every missing school slide or practical activity.
接下来继续学校毒理、肾脏、胃肠及内分泌要求。中英阅读支持本课，但不会证明所有缺失学校幻灯或实体活动已完成。
